  "strings": [
    "There was no hope of survival in that final hour\u0000",
    "for any who stood upon the battlefield, yet they did not despair.\u0000",
    "Although their enemies drew near and their arms grew weary...\u0000",
    "no man held fear in his heart.\u0000",
    "But fate decreed our world was not destined to end in that hour.\u0000",
    "For the power of the Ring corrupted all it touched\u0000",
    "in ways that even its evil spirit could not imagine.\u0000",
    "And in that final, desperate moment the Ringbearer fulfilled his quest.\u0000",
    "In a single heartbeat the Dark Lord Sauron was no more.\u0000",
    "In truth, our victory was won by the smallest of things.\u0000",
    "Our fate balanced upon the edge of a knife, but then\u0000",
    " when hope at last prevailed...\u0000",
    "That knife turned and plunged deep into the heart of our enemy.\u0000",
    "And victory at last was ours.\u0000",
    "Remember always that upon those grim battlefields\u0000",
    "the hearts of the Free Peoples did not fail...\u0000",
    "and their courage did not falter.\u0000",
    "And thus the Third Age of Middle-earth ended in triumph...\u0000",
    "and not in despair.\u0000"
  ]
}